## Design Tokens (New/Updated)

### Typography Scale
- **Display (Step titles)**: font-family: var(--font-display) [Noto Serif KR]; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.2
- **Heading (Card titles)**: font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em; line-height: 1.25
- **Label (Section overlines)**: font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-tertiary); opacity: 0.7
- **Body (default)**: font-family: Pretendard Variable; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; letter-spacing: -0.01em
- **Caption**: font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5

### Spacing Scale (Gutter-based)
- **xs**: 8px (internal micro-spacing only)
- **sm**: 12px (internal card spacing)
- **md**: 16px (section padding, list gaps)
- **lg**: 24px (block padding, major spacing)
- **xl**: 32px (container outer padding)
- **2xl**: 48px (hero/modal header whitespace)

### Shadow System (Simplified)
- **--shadow-xs**: `0 1px 2px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.04)` (never used by default)
- **--shadow-sm**: `0 2px 6px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.06), 0 0 1px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.03)` (default for all cards/surfaces)
- **--shadow-md**: `0 4px 12px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.08)` (hover state on primary CTA only)
- All other shadow levels removed; encourage flat design

### Border Radius (Unified)
- **--radius-sm**: 8px (micro-interactions only: checkboxes, badge pills)
- **--radius-md**: 12px (form inputs, small cards)
- **--radius-lg**: 20px (primary use: all major cards, containers, buttons)
- Remove 16px and 24px variants

### Color Palette (Consolidated)
**Semantic colors removed**: `--ai`, `--human`, `--collab`, `--checkpoint` (all shift to subtle alpha variations of --surface with optional 1px left border in --accent)
**Gold accent system**:
- `--accent`: #96782e (light mode base)
- `--accent-light`: #b8963e (light mode hover/active)
- `--accent-dark`: #7a6224 (light mode pressed)
- Dark mode inverted: #d4b968 / #e8d48b / #c4a055

**Border system simplified**:
- `--border`: primary divider, 1.5px weight (semantic: "sections separate")
- `--border-subtle`: secondary divider, 1px weight (semantic: "minor alignment")
- Remove --border-subtle in most places; default to no border

### Motion (Restricted to 3 curves)
- **--ease-spring**: `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` (all state changes, 250-400ms)
- **--ease-out-expo**: removed (too aggressive)
- **--ease-wave**: reserved for entrance animations only (staggered sequences)

